# Optional. Point this at a form backend that accepts a JSON POST
# (Formspree, Web3Forms, Basin, ...) and the contact form submits in place
# instead of handing the message off to the visitor's mail client.
#
#   VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#
# Leave it unset for the mailto fallback. Vite inlines VITE_* variables into
# the bundle at build time, so only ever put a public endpoint here — never a
# secret or an API key.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
